ties":{"id":"20250208130758-pxgyo2u","updated":"20250210120950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"请注意，每种编程语言都有各自的数据类型定义，它们的占用空间、取值范围和默认值可能会有所不同。"}]},{"ID":"20250210121017-5sz8ivv","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250210121017-5sz8ivv","updated":"20250210121046"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250210121017-8hwh54f","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250210121017-8hwh54f","updated":"20250210121029"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250210121017-aigbn34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250210121017-aigbn34","updated":"20250210121029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 Python 中，整数类型 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"int"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 可以是任意大小，只受限于可用内存；\n浮点数 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"float"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 是双精度 64 位；没有 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"char"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 类型，单个字符实际上是长度为 1 的字符串 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"str"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250210121017-318vwdb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250210121017-318vwdb","updated":"20250210121046"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250210121017-cf5k7ni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250210121017-cf5k7ni","updated":"20250210121046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"C 和 C++ 未明确规定基本数据类型的大小，而因实现和平台各异。\n上表遵循 LP64 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/types#Properties","TextMarkTextContent":"数据模型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，其用于包括 Linux 和 macOS 在内的 Unix 64 位操作系统。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250210121017-o1qzq9g","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250210121017-o1qzq9g","updated":"20250210121017"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250210121017-ehwapur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250210121017-ehwapur","updated":"20250210121017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"字符 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"char"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的大小在 C 和 C++ 中为 1 字节，在大多数编程语言中取决于特定的字符编码方法，详见“字符编码”章节。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250210121017-cmzf1i7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250210121017-cmzf1i7","updated":"20250210121017"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250210121017-3tkq610","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250210121017-3tkq610","updated":"20250210121017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即使表示布尔量仅需 1 位（0 或 1），它在内存中通常也存储为 1 字节。这是因为现代计算机 CPU 通常将 1 字节作为最小寻址内存单元。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250210121136-y61menq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250210121136-y61menq","updated":"20250210121136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么，基本数据类型与数据结构之间有什么联系呢？我们知道，数据结构是在计算机中组织与存储数据的方式。这句话的主语是“结构”而非“数据”。"}]},{"ID":"20250210121142-4yfjgr2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250210121142-4yfjgr2","updated":"20250210121200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果想表示“一排数字”，我们自然会想到使用数组。这是因为数组的线性结构可以表示数字的相邻关系和顺序关系，\n但至于存储的内容是整数 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"int"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、小数 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"float"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 还是字符 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"char"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ ，则与“数据结构”无关。"}]},{"ID":"20250210121157-qvfc76k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250210121157-qvfc76k","updated":"20250210121203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"换句话说，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"基本数据类型提供了数据的“内容类型”，而数据结构提供了数据的“组织方式”"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n例如以下代码，我们用相同的数据结构（数组）来存储与表示不同的基本数据类型，包括 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"int"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"float"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"char"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"bool"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 等。"}]},{"ID":"20250210121209-ivv05us","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250210121209-ivv05us","updated":"20250210121212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 使用多种基本数据类型来初始化数组\nint[] numbers = new int[5];\nfloat[] decimals = new float[5];\nchar[] characters = new char[5];\nbool[] bools = new bool[5];\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]}